    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d388">

                <pb facs="0570" n="2034" sameAs="frus:frus1951v06p2/pg2034"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">846E.2395/7–3151: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Ceylon</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Satterthwaite</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Colombo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-07-31T10:00:00+05:30">July 31, 1951—10
                            a. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>61. Embtel 60, July 31. Embassy considers leak
                    most unfortunate because possible disrupting effect on market and particularly
                    because contemplated contract (Deptel 1, July
                    2) wld fall so far short of expectation created by daily news articles that
                    general dissatisfaction locally inevitable. Embassy anticipates glut of
                    inquiries and will continue deny all knowledge until instructed otherwise.</p>
                <p>Dept pass London; sent Dept 61, rptd info London 13.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Satterthwaite</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
